================================================================================
REPOSITORY LICENSE & ATTRIBUTION NOTICE
================================================================================

This repository contains historical UNIX software components retrieved from
The Unix Heritage Society (TUHS) archive, along with minor compatibility
glue and a repackaged SIMH tape image created to make 1BSD installable on
stock Research UNIX Version 6.

Different files in this repository are governed by their respective upstream
licenses, detailed below:

1. AT&T / Caldera Ancient UNIX License
   Applies to: AT&T-derived UNIX source code in 1BSD, the base 2.79BSD ar.c
   utility, and the derived binaries/archives packaged inside 1BSD.tap.

2. UC Berkeley BSD License
   Applies to: Original UC Berkeley software included in 1BSD (Bill Joy et al.).

3. Zero-Clause BSD (0BSD) License
   Applies to: Repository packaging, 1BSD.tap image assembly, and the V6
   compatibility additions (itol, mktemp) added to ar.c.

